Description: Provides curated spatial datasets and example Zonation 5
    analysis outputs to support teaching, learning, and experimentation
    with 'ZonationR'. The package includes species distribution rasters,
    additional spatial layers, and example conservation prioritization
    results. These materials are intended for educational and demonstration
    purposes and may require further evaluation before use in research.
